P8 (Greeting Web App)

This project is a simple and clean greeting system.

Features:

- Time-based greeting system.
- Name filtering system that prevents users from entering numbers and special characters.
- Prevents users from entering single letters (a-z).
- Simple and clean UI.
- if user not enter name it display user input with Sir!.
- Reset button to reset the user input and greeting, but you can also type a new name to reset it.

No AI in this project, 0% AI.